{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","翼"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名使用诅咒和本能战斗的游侠，通过持续伤害使敌人接近死亡。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","找到了。藏匿的老鼠。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I found you all."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","爪子……更厉害了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I feel the power."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","你……死定了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","You're going to die."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","主君……对不起……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I'm sorry... My lady..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","完成了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","需要我，做什么？"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","What do you need of me."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","附近……没有老鼠。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hmm... There are no vermin nearby."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哈啊……唔……嗯？嗬呃呃——……错觉。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","*Yawn* Hmph! *Grunts* Guess it was nothing."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","鸟……嗯……啊……我什么也没看。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Is that a bird? Hmm... Oh, I didn't see anything."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","主君会喜欢它。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","是……给我的，奖励？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不好吃……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好多人……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","主君……在哪？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","所有和翼打过交道的人都会得出同一个结论：翼或许称得上可爱，但绝对算不上聪明。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","翼的“主君”是一位亡灵，翼对她非常忠诚。他认为是主君将他转化为亡灵的行为拯救了自己，赋予自己新生。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","有些时候，翼一整天都抬头望着天空。这让不少人担心他的颈椎会出问题。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","尽管翼的双腿非常有力，但他无法倒挂在树枝上。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","翼非常珍视自己的羽毛。如果他将一根羽毛送给你，要么说明他很喜欢你，要么就说明……你离死期不远了。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","翼曾经是绿裔联盟的一员。但在以亡灵姿态重生后，他彻底失去了和族人的联络。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","根据一位不知名人士透露，翼在进行监视任务的时候，曾经保持一动不动的状态长达三天半。他甚至连眼睛都不怎么眨。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","翼生前和死后最统一的特点是：不喜欢自己的黑眼圈。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","比起水浴，翼更喜欢沙浴。对他来说，羽毛被打湿意味着一旦危险降临，他将难以逃脱。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","翼有不轻的被害妄想症，曾经保护他的主君逃出并不存在的危险多达上百次。当然，这只是特殊情况。在更多的时候，翼的警觉都非常正确。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","外面，下雨了……好潮湿……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415710.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","翼 & 五月"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","不好吃……"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415725.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","翼"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","好多人……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415726.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","翼"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415768.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","奥利安 & 翼"]]}